      "slug": "tikka",
      "term": "Tikka",
      "definition": "A cooking method where small pieces of meat or fish are marinated in yogurt and spices, then cooked in a tandoor or under high dry heat. The yogurt tenderises the meat and the high heat chars the surface."
    }
