  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chicken tikka masala is a two-stage dish: first the chicken is marinated in yogurt and spices then cooked under high heat ("
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "tikka",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tikka"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " style), then it goes into a sauce of tomato, cream, and aromatics. The grill char on the chicken is what makes the sauce taste different from a plain tomato curry; without it the dish lacks depth. The marinating time is the main patience requirement."
          }
        ]
      },
